---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/layout/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer.astro';
---
<Base title="Now" description="What's running in the lab and what I'm thinking about right now.">
<style>
  .stamp { font-size: .82rem; color: var(--text-3); margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .sys { font-size: .95rem; }
  .sys .stat { color: var(--text-3); font-size: .88rem; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
</style>

<Nav variant="full" active="/now" />

<main class="col">
  <h1>Now</h1>
  <p>What's running, and what I'm thinking about. The numbers refresh nightly; the thinking refreshes when it changes.</p>
  <p class="stamp">Model data as of 2026-08-19 · page updated 2026-09-08</p>

  <h2>Thinking about</h2>
  <p>Agentic identity. AI agents authenticate with borrowed credentials and leave audit trails that point at their humans. I'm building an intent-token layer on existing standards — RFC 8693 token exchange, SPIFFE workload identity — to attest not just <em>who</em> an agent is but <em>why</em> it's acting, working toward an open-source package and a paper. <a href="/writing/the-credential-remembers-who">The Credential Remembers Who</a> and <a href="/writing/the-workload-is-the-reasoning-session">The Workload Is the Reasoning Session</a> make the argument; <a href="/writing/retiring-vessel">Retiring Vessel</a> is the story behind it.</p>

  <h2>Running</h2>
  <ul class="rows sys">
    <!-- now:commonlist -->
    <li><a class="t" href="https://commonlist.matterunknown.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Commonlist</a> — <span class="stat">contacts connected, cleaned, and merged across Google, Microsoft, Outlook, and iCloud</span></li>
    <!-- now:quant -->
    <li><a class="t" href="/projects/quant-trading">Quant scanner</a> — <span class="stat">100 symbols scanned daily · 8 positions open · paper trading</span></li>
    <!-- now:crypto -->
    <li><a class="t" href="/projects/crypto-model">Crypto model</a> — <span class="stat">21 assets scored daily · 0 buy signals</span></li>
    <!-- now:pokemon -->
    <li><a class="t" href="/projects/pokemon-model">Pokémon model</a> — <span class="stat">17,428 cards · 168 sets · top 25 updated daily</span></li>
    <!-- now:onepiece -->
    <li><a class="t" href="/projects/onepiece-model">One Piece model</a> — <span class="stat">1,035 cards · 43 sets</span></li>
    <!-- now:gpk -->
    <li><a class="t" href="/projects/gpk-model">Garbage Pail Kids model</a> — <span class="stat">11,580 cards tracked · 114 sets</span></li>
    <!-- now:building -->
    <li><span class="t">Building</span> — <span class="stat">agentic-id (intent tokens) · Harvest Haven (Roblox) · Perimeter OS</span></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Latest writing</h2>
  <ul class="rows">
    <li><span class="d">Aug 2026</span><a class="t" href="/writing/retiring-vessel">Retiring Vessel</a></li>
    <li><span class="d">Jul 2026</span><a class="t" href="/writing/the-credential-remembers-who">The Credential Remembers Who. Nothing Remembers Why.</a></li>
    <li><span class="d">Jul 2026</span><a class="t" href="/writing/the-workload-is-the-reasoning-session">The Workload Is the Reasoning Session</a></li>
  </ul>
</main>

<Footer />
</Base>
